       ],
       "label": {
        "ja": [
         "化学本館"
        ],
        "en": [
         "Chemistry Main Building"
        ]
       },
       "body": [
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "ja",
         "value": "<p>1962年完成。化学教室100周年の寄付で建てられた。当時は化学新館と呼ばれ、1983年に化学本館と改称。</p><p>出典: <a href=\"https://www.s.u-tokyo.ac.jp/en/story/newsletter/past/19830500_15_1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">理学部広報 1983年5月号</a>、<a href=\"https://www.chem.s.u-tokyo.ac.jp/chem_about/department.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">化学教室の歩み</a></p>"
        },
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "en",
         "value": "<p>Completed in 1962, funded by donations marking the chemistry department's centenary. Originally called the New Building, renamed Main Building in 1983.</p><p>Source: <a href=\"https://www.s.u-tokyo.ac.jp/en/story/newsletter/past/19830500_15_1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">理学部広報 1983年5月号</a>, <a href=\"https://www.chem.s.u-tokyo.ac.jp/chem_about/department.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">化学教室の歩み</a></p>"
        }
       ],
       "scope": [
        "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-w458704424/camera"
       ],
       "target": {
