      {
       "id": "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-w134668789",
       "type": "Annotation",
       "motivation": [
        "commenting"
       ],
       "label": {
        "ja": [
         "安田講堂"
        ],
        "en": [
         "Yasuda Auditorium"
        ]
       },
       "body": [
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "ja",
         "value": "<p>1925年竣工。設計は内田祥三と岸田日出刀。安田善次郎の寄附で建ち、2014年末に全面改修。卒業式など重要行事の会場。登録有形文化財第1号。</p><p>出典: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/ja/about/campus-guide/b07_04_b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">国の登録有形文化財 登録</a>、<a href=\"https://www.schoolexcellence.p.u-tokyo.ac.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/16ac4d38d9985b352b4f90d007fefe86.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">本郷地区キャンパスマップ 2023年度版</a>、<a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/focus/ja/articles/t_z0508_00089.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">写真でたどる昔と今の建造物（淡青36号より）</a></p>"
        },
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "en",
         "value": "<p>Completed in 1925 to designs by Uchida Yoshikazu and Kishida Hideto, funded by Yasuda Zenjiro. It hosts graduation and other major ceremonies and was the first registered tangible cultural property (1996).</p><p>Source: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/ja/about/campus-guide/b07_04_b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">国の登録有形文化財 登録</a>, <a href=\"https://www.schoolexcellence.p.u-tokyo.ac.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/16ac4d38d9985b352b4f90d007fefe86.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">本郷地区キャンパスマップ 2023年度版</a>, <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/focus/ja/articles/t_z0508_00089.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">写真でたどる昔と今の建造物（淡青36号より）</a></p>"
        }
       ],
       "scope": [
        "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-w134668789/camera"
       ],
