      },
      {
       "id": "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-w142583749",
       "type": "Annotation",
       "motivation": [
        "commenting"
       ],
       "label": {
        "ja": [
         "山上会館"
        ],
        "en": [
         "Sanjo Conference Hall"
        ]
       },
       "body": [
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "ja",
         "value": "<p>1986年竣工。関東大震災で焼失した山上会議所の跡地に建つ。会議室とレストランをもつ。</p><p>出典: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/focus/ja/articles/t_z0508_00089.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">写真でたどる昔と今の建造物（淡青36号より）</a>、<a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/content/400293843.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">全面改修・改築予定建物一覧（2026年6月時点）</a></p>"
        },
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "en",
         "value": "<p>Completed in 1986 on the site of the earlier Sanjo conference hall lost in the 1923 earthquake. Has meeting rooms and a restaurant.</p><p>Source: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/focus/ja/articles/t_z0508_00089.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">写真でたどる昔と今の建造物（淡青36号より）</a>, <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/content/400293843.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">全面改修・改築予定建物一覧（2026年6月時点）</a></p>"
        }
       ],
       "scope": [
        "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-w142583749/camera"
       ],
