      {
       "id": "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-r9693129",
       "type": "Annotation",
       "motivation": [
        "commenting"
       ],
       "label": {
        "ja": [
         "工学部2号館"
        ],
        "en": [
         "Faculty of Engineering Building 2"
        ]
       },
       "body": [
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "ja",
         "value": "<p>内田祥三が構内で最初に設計した建物で、1924年竣工。2005年に旧館の上に高層の新館を載せる形で拡充された。</p><p>出典: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/focus/ja/articles/t_z0508_00089.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">写真でたどる昔と今の建造物（淡青36号より）</a></p>"
        },
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "en",
         "value": "<p>The first campus building designed by Uchida Yoshikazu, completed 1924. In 2005 a high-rise new wing was built over the old building.</p><p>Source: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/focus/ja/articles/t_z0508_00089.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">写真でたどる昔と今の建造物（淡青36号より）</a></p>"
        }
       ],
       "scope": [
