      },
      {
       "id": "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-r1682271",
       "type": "Annotation",
       "motivation": [
        "commenting"
       ],
       "label": {
        "ja": [
         "工学部6号館"
        ],
        "en": [
         "Faculty of Engineering Building 6"
        ]
       },
       "body": [
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "ja",
         "value": "<p>1938年建築。法文1・2号館と同じく、戦後に屋上階が増築された。物理工学科・物理工学専攻が入る。</p><p>出典: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/content/400293843.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">全面改修・改築予定建物一覧（2026年6月時点）</a>、<a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/ja/about/campus-guide/b07_04_b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">国の登録有形文化財 登録</a>、<a href=\"https://www.ap.t.u-tokyo.ac.jp/access.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">アクセス（物理工学科）</a></p>"
        },
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "en",
         "value": "<p>Built 1938. Like Law & Letters Buildings 1 and 2, it received a rooftop addition after the war. Home to the Department of Applied Physics.</p><p>Source: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/content/400293843.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">全面改修・改築予定建物一覧（2026年6月時点）</a>, <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/ja/about/campus-guide/b07_04_b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">国の登録有形文化財 登録</a>, <a href=\"https://www.ap.t.u-tokyo.ac.jp/access.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">アクセス（物理工学科）</a></p>"
        }
       ],
       "scope": [
        "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-r1682271/camera"
       ],
