       "body": [
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "ja",
         "value": "<p>1928年12月竣工。関東大震災後、ロックフェラー・ジュニアの寄付で再建。内田祥三の設計監督で、鉄骨鉄筋コンクリート造。</p><p>出典: <a href=\"https://www.lib.u-tokyo.ac.jp/ja/library/general/about/history/history_0/history_2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">図書館再建（震災直後から昭和初期）</a>、<a href=\"https://www.schoolexcellence.p.u-tokyo.ac.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/16ac4d38d9985b352b4f90d007fefe86.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">本郷地区キャンパスマップ 2023年度版</a></p>"
        },
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "en",
         "value": "<p>Completed in December 1928, rebuilt after the 1923 earthquake with a donation from John D. Rockefeller Jr., under Uchida Yoshikazu's design supervision.</p><p>Source: <a href=\"https://www.lib.u-tokyo.ac.jp/ja/library/general/about/history/history_0/history_2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">図書館再建（震災直後から昭和初期）</a>, <a href=\"https://www.schoolexcellence.p.u-tokyo.ac.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/16ac4d38d9985b352b4f90d007fefe86.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">本郷地区キャンパスマップ 2023年度版</a></p>"
        }
       ],
       "scope": [
        "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-w240758655/camera"
       ],
       "target": {
        "type": "SpecificResource",
        "source": [
         {
          "id": "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#scene",
          "type": "Scene"
         }
        ],
        "selector": [
         {
          "type": "PointSelector",
          "x": -117.1,
          "y": 44.62,
          "z": 131.91
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "id": "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-w134668792",
       "type": "Annotation",
       "motivation": [
        "commenting"
       ],
       "label": {
        "ja": [
         "法文1号館"
        ],
        "en": [
         "Law & Letters Building 1"
        ]
       },
       "body": [
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "ja",
         "value": "<p>西側部分は1929年2月、全体は1935年2月の竣工。尖頭アーチのアーケードをもつ震災復興期の建物。西側は文学部の教室。登録有形文化財。</p><p>出典: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/ja/about/campus-guide/b07_04_b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">国の登録有形文化財 登録</a>、<a href=\"https://www.l.u-tokyo.ac.jp/access.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">アクセス（文学部）</a></p>"
        },
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "en",
         "value": "<p>Western wing completed February 1929, whole building February 1935, as part of the post-earthquake reconstruction. Its western part houses Faculty of Letters classrooms. Registered tangible cultural property.</p><p>Source: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/ja/about/campus-guide/b07_04_b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">国の登録有形文化財 登録</a>, <a href=\"https://www.l.u-tokyo.ac.jp/access.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">アクセス（文学部）</a></p>"
        }
       ],
       "scope": [
        "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-w134668792/camera"
       ],
       "target": {
        "type": "SpecificResource",
