          "id": "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#scene",
          "type": "Scene"
         }
        ],
        "selector": [
         {
          "type": "PointSelector",
          "x": -96.98,
          "y": 35.26,
          "z": -57.25
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "id": "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-r6859326",
       "type": "Annotation",
       "motivation": [
        "commenting"
       ],
       "label": {
        "ja": [
         "法文2号館"
        ],
        "en": [
         "Law & Letters Building 2"
        ]
       },
       "body": [
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "ja",
         "value": "<p>1938年竣工。設計は内田祥三。三廊式のアーケードが特徴。文学部の事務室と研究室が入り、地下に食堂・購買部。登録有形文化財。</p><p>出典: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/content/400076823.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">広報誌「淡青」36号</a>、<a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/ja/about/campus-guide/b07_04_b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">国の登録有形文化財 登録</a>、<a href=\"https://www.l.u-tokyo.ac.jp/access.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">アクセス（文学部）</a></p>"
        },
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "en",
         "value": "<p>Completed in 1938 to a design by Uchida Yoshikazu, with a three-aisle arcade. It houses the Faculty of Letters office and laboratories, plus shops in the basement. Registered tangible cultural property.</p><p>Source: <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/content/400076823.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">広報誌「淡青」36号</a>, <a href=\"https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/ja/about/campus-guide/b07_04_b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">国の登録有形文化財 登録</a>, <a href=\"https://www.l.u-tokyo.ac.jp/access.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">アクセス（文学部）</a></p>"
        }
       ],
       "scope": [
        "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-r6859326/camera"
