      {
       "id": "https://nakamura196.github.io/hongo-campus-iiif/hongo.json#osm-w137625393",
       "type": "Annotation",
       "motivation": [
        "commenting"
       ],
       "label": {
        "ja": [
         "理学部1号館 西棟"
        ],
        "en": [
         "Faculty of Science Building 1, West Wing"
        ]
       },
       "body": [
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "ja",
         "value": "<p>1998年竣工。地下2階・地上12階。設計は東京大学施設部と日建設計。</p><p>出典: <a href=\"https://www.s.u-tokyo.ac.jp/en/overview/pdf/Bldg1-west-1998.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">理学部1号館(西棟)の竣工にあたって</a></p>"
        },
        {
         "type": "TextualBody",
         "format": "text/html",
         "language": "en",
         "value": "<p>Completed in 1998, 12 floors above ground and 2 below. Designed by the university's Facilities Department with Nikken Sekkei.</p><p>Source: <a href=\"https://www.s.u-tokyo.ac.jp/en/overview/pdf/Bldg1-west-1998.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">理学部1号館(西棟)の竣工にあたって</a></p>"
        }
       ],
